        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>TVs have come a long way in the last few years. MiniLED sets are slimmer, brighter, boast impressive features and also have the ability to double as monitors for all your gaming needs. If you\u2019re looking for a new TV that can fit in with all the demands of modern life then MiniLED is the way to go. But, not all work in the same way though, so you\u2019ll want one that gives the best performance in a wide range of settings and with a variety of content. Here\u2019s some things to consider when deciding on a new TV that will fit your home.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"how-will-the-tv-cope-in-brightly-lit-rooms\">How will the TV cope in brightly lit rooms?</h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"extendedBlock-wrapper block-coreImage undefined\"><figure data-wp-context='{\"imageId\":\"6a5feca4d9ee6\"}' data-wp-interactive=\"core/image\" class=\"wp-block-image size-large wp-lightbox-containe",
